    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #366\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed the new commit to the existing branch: `bb/relay-215-implementation-audit-fixes-08-23-add-t-thr_4nea8pdjkw`\n\n## Summary\n\nPushed the fix for PR #366's code review findings on `services/semprec-ai-gateway/src/structuredProviders/anthropicProvider.ts`:\n\n- **High (correctness):** replaced a bare type-asserted parse of the Anthropic response with a runtime type guard (`isAnthropicMessagesResponse`) that checks for a `content` array before accessing it, so a malformed 200 response now correctly throws `ProviderCallError` (→ `502 provider_failed`) instead of an uncaught `TypeError` (→ generic `500`).\n- **Medium (security):** replaced the unbounded `res.json()` call with a streaming reader capped at 10 MiB, independent of any `Content-Length` header, preventing unbounded memory use from a pathologically large or malformed provider response.\n- Added an observability log for the `ProviderCallError` path in `completeHandler.ts`, and added unit test coverage for `anthropicProvider.ts` (previously untested): malformed-shape response, oversized response, and the happy path.\n\nFull backend pipeline re-verified after the fix: build, lint, format:check, check:pi-import-paths, check-migration-numbering, check:boundaries, test:unit (150 passed), test:integration (897 passed), test:e2e (5 passed) — all green.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
