    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #366\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nNo uncommitted changes remained; the fix commit was already in place and has been pushed.\n\nBranch: `bb/relay-215-implementation-audit-fixes-08-23-add-t-thr_4nea8pdjkw`\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded the AI gateway structured completion endpoint and client port for issue #215, and addressed all code-review feedback across three review rounds:\n\n- `packages/shared`: `AiGatewayClientPort` interface, `AiGatewayCompletionInput`/`Result` types, `AiGatewayFailedError`.\n- `packages/ai-gateway-client`: HTTP client implementation with timeout handling, strict response validation, and a size-capped streaming response reader (1 MiB cap) to prevent unbounded buffering of a malformed or oversized response.\n- `packages/data`/`packages/ai-gateway`: additive migration and threading of `projectItemId`/`operation` through the existing accounting wrapper.\n- `services/semprec-ai-gateway`: new service exposing `POST /internal/complete`, with bearer-token auth, Ajv-based request/response JSON-Schema validation, an Anthropic structured-output provider (forced tool-use technique) with a runtime type guard and size-capped response reading, and strict request validation — including a fix so out-of-range `temperature` values (Anthropic only accepts `[0, 1]`) are now rejected as `400 validation_failed` instead of surfacing as a confusing `502 provider_failed`.\n\nVerified with the full pipeline: build, lint, format:check, check:boundaries, check:pi-import-paths, check-migration-numbering, test:unit (151 passed), test:integration (898 passed), test:e2e (5 passed) — all green.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
